  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-gallery/mdm4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></em></p>\n<h1>现代装饰</h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>这是一款专注于将简洁的现代风格内饰带入《我的世界》的模组。它添加了各类家具与装饰元素，助你打造细节丰富、逼真自然的居住空间，从温馨居室到完整设计的现代住宅应有尽有。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>特色功能</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>适用于多种房间类型的现代家具</strong></li>\n<li>精致的<strong>室内配件</strong></li>\n<li>时尚的<strong>灯光元素</strong></li>\n<li>专为<strong>逼真室内设计</strong>打造的方块</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcookiecraftmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/generated/fhfuc7slzawvi/2025-11-29_rest-0338e8b30091e10a20507b1b977b3b03-p3s7pb6w.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"600\"></a><br><br></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3>有什么内容是你希望添加到本模组中的吗？或者你发现了什么漏洞？欢迎加入我们的 Discord 社区！</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrVTtKNRkn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://theme.zdassets.com/theme_assets/678183/cc59daa07820943e943c2fc283b9079d7003ff76.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"24\"></a></p>\n<p>如需获取更详细的信息或技术支持，请访问我们的官网：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cookiecraftmods.com</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/cookiecraftmods-logo-nobg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/edm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/builders-palette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/bp-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmhouse-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/fdm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/CCM-FULL-BANNER-text.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fZ8Z21OHRJY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi1.png?v=6\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 上请我喝杯咖啡\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">以下是一些游戏内截图：(图片来源 -&gt; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">cookiecraftmods.com</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/mdm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mdm-livingroom2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/bathroom.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/office-mdmxedm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"> (此处使用了来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252fmods%252fedm%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">edm</a> 的元素)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/terracemdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"